<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 104,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 104,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog receipts Wednesday were 104,000 head, compared with the estimate of 100,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts mostly steady to $0.50 per cwt lower compared to midsession Wednesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		    Plains</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    58.50 - 60.00	  59.50 - 61.00</p>
<p>few			58.00 &amp; 60.50	  59.00 &amp; 61.50</p>
<p>one interest few     57.50		    58.50</p>
<p>Sows:  steady. US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  46.00 -47.00	   47.00 -49.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   47.00 -49.00	   47.00 -49.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    50.00 -53.00	   50.00 -55.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
